            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- MacBeads now tells you when an Update is available, shows what changed, and lets you install it, skip it or be reminded later.
- Check for Updates… is in the MacBeads menu, and Settings has options for checking and installing automatically.
- After an Update, the Release notes for the new version appear the first time you open it.
- Help ▸ MacBeads Release Notes shows the notes for every version.
]]></description>
